  },
  "vaporizer-regulator": {
   "difficulty": 9,
   "notes": "Only source reported is the Vaporizer ARC during Close Scrutiny. Repeatedly required by projects (High-Gain Antenna, Avian Alarm, Expedition 4, Ascending the Mountain). v4 listed Riven Tides as the map; current sources say it is not map-restricted, so no map is asserted."
  },
  "magnetic-accelerator": {
   "notes": "Drops from The Queen and the Matriarch; Magnetron and both reactors also recycle into it. Required by Trophy Display stage 4 and several Expeditions."
