     "title": "Gondola Transceivers are request points, not landing spots",
     "body": "Use a Gondola Transceiver to call the gondola. The gondola may land some distance away from the transceiver. Plan your route to it, especially if you are downed or carrying a downed teammate. Landing locations are not marked on this map.",
