      {
       "text": "Look for three cues once it is on its way: an incoming-gondola marker on your map, the transceiver light pointing toward the landing area, and green smoke rising where it will touch down.",
       "status": "REPORTED",
       "source": "gondola"
      },
      {
       "text": "The gondola carries three enclosed pods, one Raider per pod.",
       "status": "REPORTED",
       "source": "gondola"
